08056DBC shake-icon-tick-return

The sole installed update callback, ShakeIconDisplay_TickShake, returns
through r0 to 08056DCB. The expired path calls Task_Kill, which returns zero.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/ui/hud/shake_icon_display.c
+++ b/src/ui/hud/shake_icon_display.c
@@ -28,5 +28,11 @@
             Script_Call(display->completionScriptId, 0);
         Task_Kill(display);
+#ifdef UBFIX
+        return 0;
+#endif
     }
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return 0x08056DCB;
+#endif
 }
 
